/tests/fixtures/private/

# Internal release evidence: captured pytest transcripts, per-unit progress records and
# the blocker ledger for the managed-reconciliation work. This repository is public, and
# these carry the organisation's Jira keys, Confluence page ids and absolute local paths.
# Most of them are verbatim failure transcripts, so scrubbing the identifiers would edit
# the record rather than redact it. They are kept with the release artifacts, outside
# this repository; the maintainer's notes say where.
/docs/release-evidence/
/docs/release-0.3.4-runbook.md
